"  •   0 (landscape)\n"
"  •  90 (portrait)\n"
"  • 180 (landscape flipped)\n"
"  • 270 (portrait flipped)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Komma geskeide lys van moniteer IDs en werkskerm oriëntasies:\n"
"  • [<id>:<orientation-in-degrees>,]\n"
"  • 0,1,2,3\n"
"  • 0:270,1:90\n"
"Oriëntasies word in grade gespesifiseer, geldige waardes is:\n"
"  •   0 (landscape)\n"
"  •  90 (portrait)\n"
"  • 180 (landscape flipped)\n"
"  • 270 (portrait flipped)\n"
"\n"

